  "outfits": [
    {
      "id": 203500,
      "name": "Summerchill Dreams",
      "description": "Qiqi's outfit. A herb gatherer's garment that brings her great peace of mind due to the attached talismans.",
      "isDefault": true,
      "characterName": "Qiqi",
      "characterId": 10000035,
      "filename_card": "UI_AvatarIcon_Costume_Card",
      "filename_iconCircle": "UI_AvatarIcon_Qiqi_Circle"
    }
  ],
  "voices": [
    {
      "id": "1000",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Hello",
      "text": "I am Qiqi. I am a zombie. And I... forgot what comes next."
    },
    {
      "id": "1101",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Chat: Talking to Herself",
      "text": "Hey, do you know what? Uhh... neither do I. I... already forgot."
    },
    {
      "id": "1102",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Chat: Afraid of Heat",
      "text": "Let's go somewhere cooler."
    },
    {
      "id": "1103",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Chat: Training",
      "text": "One, two, three, four. Two, two, three, four..."
    },
    {
      "id": "1201",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "When It Rains",
      "text": "I forgot my umbrella again."
    },
    {
      "id": "1202",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "When It Snows",
      "text": "I want to build a snowman. Will you help?"
    },
    {
      "id": "1203",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "When the Sun Is Out",
      "text": "I should have stayed indoors today."
    },
    {
      "id": "1204",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "When It's Windy",
      "text": "The wind is... frigid. I like it."
    },
    {
      "id": "1205",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "When the Wind Is Blowing",
      "text": "Hold my hand please. This wind could blow me away."
    },
    {
      "id": "1001",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Good Morning",
      "text": "Morning means it's time to check my diary. Because my diary reminds me what I'm supposed to do in the morning."
    },
    {
      "id": "1002",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Good Afternoon",
      "text": "I just remembered something. I forgot to help Dr. Baizhu prepare medications."
    },
    {
      "id": "1003",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Good Evening",
      "text": "Good evening. How was your day? My day was... fine, I think. But I can't remember."
    },
    {
      "id": "1004",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Good Night",
      "text": "It's time for you to sleep now. I will do my stretches. ...Do not watch me, please."
    },
    {
      "id": "2001",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "About Qiqi",
      "text": "Did you ask me something? Sorry... I forgot."
    },
    {
      "id": "2002",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "About Us: Memory",
      "text": "I have a poor memory for most things. But as far as I know, that doesn't matter."
    },
    {
      "id": "2003",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "About Us: Memory Training",
      "text": "I started memory training exercises recently. So don't worry, I won't forget who you are."
    },
    {
      "id": "3001",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "About the Vision",
      "text": "My Vision can't turn back time. But at least it gives me the power to protect the people that matter most."
    },
    {
      "id": "3002",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Something to Share",
      "text": "I may be a corpse, but I am in a much better physical condition than Dr. Baizhu."
    },
    {
      "id": "3003",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Interesting Things",
      "text": "Sometimes I see finches near the pharmacy. A nice little group of finches."
    },
    {
      "id": "4001",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "About Baizhu",
      "text": "I can never remember Dr. Baizhu's face. But I don't mind."
    },
    {
      "id": "4002",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "About Hu Tao",
      "text": "Warm. Fake smile. Death. I despise Hu Tao."
    },
    {
      "id": "4003",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "About Xiao: Name",
      "text": "Sounds like a historical artifact to me."
    },
    {
      "id": "4004",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "About Xiao: Memory",
      "text": "Remind me, have I met him before?"
    },
    {
      "id": "4005",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "About Xinyan",
      "text": "...Who?"
    },
    {
      "id": "4006",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "About Yaoyao",
      "text": "Cute. Like a nice little finch."
    },
    {
      "id": "4007",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "About Dusky Ming",
      "text": "On some nights, I almost feel like someone is doing stretches together with me. But maybe I just have an overactive imagination."
    },
    {
      "id": "4008",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "About Prune",
      "text": "She looks tough on the outside... but her palms are nice and soft. I like her."
    },
    {
      "id": "5001",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "More About Qiqi: I",
      "text": "What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "id": "5002",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "More About Qiqi: II",
      "text": "I perform stretches regularly to help me maintain the same range of movement as a normal human being. But as soon as I stop doing them, the rigor mortis starts to set in again."
    },
    {
      "id": "5003",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "More About Qiqi: III",
      "text": "Some people want to take advantage of me. Others are terrified of me. But you... You are not like any of those people."
    },
    {
      "id": "5004",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "More About Qiqi: IV",
      "text": "Since we first met, I have had a warm feeling inside. Not the kind of warmth that makes me feel rotten. The other kind of warm. The one that happens inside my heart. Thank you. I am happy. Sadly I only recognize the current you. If I forget you... No. I will order myself to remember you."
    },
    {
      "id": "5005",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "More About Qiqi: V",
      "text": "In the past, my only thought was: I must stay alive. Even though I didn't know what to live for. But now, I think I know. I want to live with you. I want to ask, can we always stay together, for the rest of life, until death? Yes or no? Yes? Is that your real answer? Good, excellent. I promise to always protect you."
    },
    {
      "id": "6001",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Qiqi's Hobbies",
      "text": "I want to have a pet. For example, a nice little finch."
    },
    {
      "id": "6002",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Qiqi's Troubles",
      "text": "I don't know why, but high temperatures make me feel... disgusting."
    },
    {
      "id": "6003",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Favorite Food",
      "text": "I like coconut milk... But, I don't know what it tastes like."
    },
    {
      "id": "6004",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Least Favorite Food",
      "text": "Sorry, I have no idea."
    },
    {
      "id": "6007",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Receiving a Gift: I",
      "text": "Cold. I like it. But, no flavor..."
    },
    {
      "id": "6008",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Receiving a Gift: II",
      "text": "Huh..."
    },
    {
      "id": "6009",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Receiving a Gift: III",
      "text": "It's burning my tongue..."
    },
    {
      "id": "7001",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Birthday",
      "text": "Many happy returns. Here is a bag of herbal medicine for you. You must be very surprised that I remembered? Let me explain. Last time you told me, I wrote your birthday down on a piece of paper. If I look at something once a day, it eventually goes into my long-term memory, and it will stay there forever."
    },
    {
      "id": "8001",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Feelings About Ascension: Intro",
      "text": "Now, I have more power. But... what does that mean? Please explain. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "id": "8002",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Feelings About Ascension: Building Up",
      "text": "Ah, I understand. When I get stronger, I need to put more effort into controlling my strength."
    },
    {
      "id": "8003",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Feelings About Ascension: Climax",
      "text": "In the past, I did not understand the idea of being stronger than I already was. Now that I understand it well, I wish I was just a little stronger still."
    },
    {
      "id": "8004",
      "type": 1,
      "title": "Feelings About Ascension: Conclusion",
      "text": "All of this is because of you. Thank you very much. Can you make me a promise? From now on, please, let me protect you. Do you accept? Yes or no?"
    },
    {
      "id": "100001",
      "type": 2,
      "title": "Elemental Skill: I",
      "text": "Wheel of life."
    },
    {
      "id": "100002",
      "type": 2,
      "title": "Elemental Skill: II",
      "text": "Life goes on."
    },
    {
      "id": "100003",
      "type": 2,
      "title": "Elemental Skill: III",
      "text": "Go."
    },
    {
      "id": "100004",
      "type": 2,
      "title": "Elemental Skill: IV",
      "text": "Rise."
    },
    {
      "id": "200001",
