      "title": "Elemental Burst: II",
      "text": "Sacred name: Fortune Preserver."
    },
    {
      "id": "200003",
      "type": 2,
      "title": "Elemental Burst: III",
      "text": "Opening box of Adepti tricks."
    },
    {
      "id": "700001",
      "type": 2,
      "title": "Sprint Start: I",
      "text": "Faster? Okay, faster."
    },
    {
      "id": "800001",
      "type": 2,
      "title": "Deploying Wind Glider: I",
      "text": "Uh... Huh..."
    },
    {
      "id": "300001",
      "type": 2,
      "title": "Opening Treasure Chest: I",
      "text": "Ooh, pretty."
    },
    {
      "id": "300002",
      "type": 2,
      "title": "Opening Treasure Chest: II",
      "text": "Treasure chests... hmm... do we like treasure chests?"
    },
    {
      "id": "300003",
      "type": 2,
      "title": "Opening Treasure Chest: III",
      "text": "Wasn't there something in here a second ago...?"
    },
    {
      "id": "410001",
      "type": 2,
      "title": "Low HP: I",
      "text": "Ow."
    },
    {
      "id": "410002",
      "type": 2,
